  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Heat a medium saucepan with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic paste until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the boiling water and a good pinch of salt.\n• Add wholemeal couscous. Stir to combine, place a lid on the saucepan and remove from heat.\n• Leave until all the water is absorbed, 6 minutes. Fluff up with fork and set aside uncovered.\n• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6322e693000c97da00056f73/step-b3045c0d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop semi-dried tomatoes and baby spinach leaves. Finely chop celery.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook remaining garlic paste until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small bowl. Crumble in fetta cubes and mash to combine. Stir in Greek style yoghurt until combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6322e693000c97da00056f73/step-51570b12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Add caramelised onion chutney, Italian herbs (see ingredients) and a splash of water. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6322e693000c97da00056f73/step-7128c708.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the couscous, add semi-dried tomatoes, spinach, celery and a drizzle of olive oil and balsamic vinegar.\n• Toss to combine and season to taste.\n• Divide wholemeal couscous salad between bowls.\n• Top with herby haloumi & caramelised onion chutney and garlic-fetta yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6322e693000c97da00056f73/step-1bae1486.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
